            "scene": "exposition/property_intake",
            "text": "\"Keep the lot,\" you repeat, glancing at the distant facilities sign.\n\n\"How generous,\" the clerk says, writing VOLUNTARY CONTRIBUTION on the inventory card. The four trays slide away. \"Your donation will be displayed or disposed of according to its educational value.\"\n\nThere is no claim ticket. There is, however, a clear route to the reception desk.",
