            "objective": "ASK AT RECEPTION WHERE THE BATHROOM IS.",
            "text": "Beyond the property counter, the reception hall is spacious and meticulously arranged. A desk occupies the far wall. Behind it, a receptionist looks up as you approach.\n\nAt last, someone who can give you directions.",
